      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Upon arrival at the Chattisgarh destination, the final delivery phase commences with strict daylight verification. The receiving team must ensure adequate natural lighting to accurately inspect all items against the original inventory bilty.</p>
